{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From iOS 26, a page in Safari can ask for an ISO mdoc with the W3C"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol (ISO\/IEC TS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-7 Annex C). iOS offers the apps that registered a matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document, and shows the chosen app’s document provider extension for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder’s consent. The extension answers through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response goes back through Safari, encrypted to the page, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network request from the wallet."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Safari sends only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":", not OpenID4VP, and on iOS only:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Safari on macOS has no document providers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Set-up-the-app-and-its-extension","text":"Set up the app and its extension","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The extension:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" a target whose Info.plist names the extension","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.identity-document-services.document-provider-ui","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"EXAppExtensionAttributes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"EXExtensionPointIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The capability:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Digital Credentials API – Mobile Document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, on both the app’s and the extension’s App IDs, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doctypes the app presents in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.developer.identity-document-services.document-provider.mobile-document-types","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entitlement. Apple allows only certain doctypes, such as the ISO mDL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and Photo ID.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared storage:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the extension is another process, so the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps its credentials in an App Group both list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"reference"},{"text":"), and its holder keys in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a Keychain access group both list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference"},{"text":"). Instance and DPoP","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keys stay in the app’s own group: the extension presents, but doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receive. The app saves its configuration where the extension can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read it too.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["import Foundation","import IdentityDocumentServices","import IdentityDocumentServicesUI","import OID4VCWallet","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ What the app and its document provider extension share.","enum SharedWallet {","    static let appGroup = \"group.com.example.wallet\"","    static let holderKeyGroup = \"ABCDE12345.com.example.wallet.shared\"","","    \/\/\/ The configuration the app saved in the group's defaults.","    static func configuration() throws -> WalletConfiguration {","        guard let data = UserDefaults(suiteName: appGroup)?.data(forKey: \"configuration\") else { throw CocoaError(.fileNoSuchFile) }","        return try JSONDecoder().decode(WalletConfiguration.self, from: data)","    }","","    \/\/\/ The wallet over the shared store and holder keys: the app passes","    \/\/\/ its Wallet Provider; the extension, which only presents, nil.","    static func open(provider: (any WalletProvider)?) throws -> Wallet {","        try Wallet(","            configuration: try configuration(),","            keyStore: KeychainKeyStore(options: .init(holderAccessGroup: holderKeyGroup)),","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.inAppGroup(appGroup),","            provider: provider)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Register-the-documents","text":"Register the documents","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS offers the app only for documents it registered. Whenever the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials change, register each presentable mdoc and remove the rest."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" names the reader CAs, by subject key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, whose requests the document answers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Registers the held mdocs of `doctypes` with iOS, so Safari offers the","\/\/\/ app for them. The first registration asks the holder to allow it.","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","func registerDocuments(_ credentials: [CredentialSummary], doctypes: Set<String>, readerAuthorities: [Data]) async throws {","    let store = IdentityDocumentProviderRegistrationStore()","    for registration in try await store.registrations {","        try await store.removeRegistration(forDocumentIdentifier: registration.documentIdentifier)","    }","    for credential in credentials where credential.format == \"mso_mdoc\" && doctypes.contains(credential.doctype ?? \"\") {","        try await store.addRegistration(MobileDocumentRegistration(","            mobileDocumentType: credential.doctype ?? \"\",","            supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers: readerAuthorities,","            documentIdentifier: credential.id,","            invalidationDate: credential.validUntil))","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Answer-in-the-extension","text":"Answer in the extension","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS hands the extension the request in two stages. First,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.request"},{"type":"text","text":" describes what’s asked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the consent screen: show it with the website’s origin, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidates from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder shares does iOS release the request itself, to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sendResponse"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s closure. Validate it there, parse it, check it’s what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder was shown, and answer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct WalletDocumentProvider: IdentityDocumentProvider {","    var body: some IdentityDocumentRequestScene {","        ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestScene { context in","            ConsentView(context: context)","        }","    }","","    func performRegistrationUpdates() async {}","}","","struct RequestChanged: Error {}","","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct ConsentView: View {","    let context: ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Share\") { Task { try await share(credentialID: nil) } }","    }","","    \/\/\/ Shares the held mdoc `credentialID` (the first candidate when","    \/\/\/ nil) for the request's first document.","    func share(credentialID: String?) async throws {","        guard let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","              let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","        let wallet = try SharedWallet.open(provider: nil)","        try await context.sendResponse { raw in","            _ = try IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequestValidator()","                .validateISO18013MobileDocumentRequest(raw.requestData, origin: originURL)","            let presentation = try await wallet.startMdocPresentation(requestData: raw.requestData, origin: origin)","            guard let document = presentation.request.documents.first,","                  let chosen = credentialID ?? document.credentials.first?.id else { throw RequestChanged() }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            let response = try await presentation.respond(document: 0, credentialID: chosen, elements: document.elements)","            return ISO18013MobileDocumentResponse(responseData: response.response)","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A real consent screen compares the released request with what it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"showed — the same document, elements and reader — and refuses one that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed. The demo wallet’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" target does this in full."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Name-the-reader","text":"Name the reader","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A page’s request may be signed by its reader’s certificate (ISO\/IEC"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-5 reader authentication). When the certificate chains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names it; otherwise show only the website’s origin."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issued for readers, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses requests from any other reader before the holder sees them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Warn-of-linkable-presentations","text":"Warn of linkable presentations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each candidate’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting it would hand this website a copy another website has seen,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whether it did. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension doesn’t refresh used-up copies: have the app do it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next becomes active, after listing its credentials again."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Presenting to Safari","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-to-Safari","title":"Presenting to Safari","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/Request-swift.struct/reader":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"reader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/request-swift.struct\/reader","abstract":[{"text":"The subject common name of the reader that signed the request,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"when its certificate chains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"WalletConfiguration.mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; “” when the holder can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only be shown ","type":"text"},{"code":"origin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startMdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestData","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"origin","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/startmdocpresentation(requestdata:origin:)","abstract":[{"text":"Parses an ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request — an mdoc asked for over the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Digital Credentials API, as iOS hands one to a document provider","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extension — and finds the held mdocs that can answer it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"requestData","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequest.requestData","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":";","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"origin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the requesting page’s origin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.requestingWebsiteOrigin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as ","type":"text"},{"code":"MdocPresentation.origin(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" serializes it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/Response/linkable":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linkable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"linkable","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/response\/linkable","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the copy presented had been seen by another Verifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requireTrustedMdocReader":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requireTrustedMdocReader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"requireTrustedMdocReader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requiretrustedmdocreader","abstract":[{"text":"Refuses an ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request no recognized reader signed:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"startMdocPresentation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"untrustedVerifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and nothing is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown to the holder. Needs ","type":"text"},{"code":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MdocPresentation","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request (ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7 Annex C): show","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"request","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the holder’s consent, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"respond","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once; to decline,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancel the platform’s request — nothing is sent to the reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"respond","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"document","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credentialID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elements","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC7ElementV"},{"text":"]) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Response","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC8ResponseV"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/respond(document:credentialid:elements:)","abstract":[{"text":"Presents the held mdoc ","type":"text"},{"code":"credentialID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for document number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"document","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", disclosing exactly ","type":"text"},{"code":"elements","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", each one it requested.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The holder key signs now, so a key store requiring user presence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prompts.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRequireEKU":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocReaderRequireEKU","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"mdocReaderRequireEKU","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderrequireeku","abstract":[{"text":"Recognizes only reader certificates with the ISO\/IEC 18013-5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader authentication extended key usage (1.0.18013.5.1.6), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate issued for another role under ","type":"text"},{"code":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t taken for a reader’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/linkableHere":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linkableHere","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"linkableHere","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/linkablehere","abstract":[{"text":"Whether presenting it to the Verifier asking would hand it a copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another Verifier has seen. Set only on a presentation’s candidates.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRoots":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"